 how are we  gonna get our guys ready how are we  gonna put the best team possible how are  we gonna put the best coaching staff  together and that that's why Gregg is  the the first guy that really that we're  getting on board right now is he's gonna  be involved in with with doing that and  I when he gets here than him and myself  we're gonna hammer this defensive staff  I'll get that put together and then  eventually the offensive staff is going  to come together and then then we're  going to be ready to roll like I'm  excited I I just keep picturing practice  of this is what's going to be the  difference maker for us is it's gonna be  like a game every day because the  competition and the competitiveness  between Gregg myself  the staffs that's what you want that's  how you get that energy you want to  where the players feel that they're  practicing like that they're creating  that attitude so now all of a sudden  becomes the fourth quarter it's a close  game our guys have been there before the  New York Post has already brought up the  bounty issue I know it's been seven  years but Gregg Williams was right in  the middle of that it was a black eye  for the Saints for the league does that  come up at all in your thought process  is there even a little piece of you that  has to resolve that everything's fine  there it's not going to be an issue it's  not gonna be a problem it's not gonna be  something that drags us down we can get  past that I just Gregg Gregg paid his a  great great was penalized for that  heavily and football was taken away from  him like Heep he did his time and you  know that's what makes this country  great right it some people get second  chances all the time he's gotten a  second chance he's done it right he's  gone and he has worked extremely hard to  do things right and for me to media or  anyone else to hold that over his head  to me is it's wrong it's it's just like  when we give players second  opportunities it's the same thing people